#### 2. Response Envelope Structure

**Standard Response Format:**

```json
{
  "items": [
    { /* resource object */ }
  ],
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "pageSize": 50,
    "totalRecords": 12543,
    "totalPages": 251,
    "hasMore": true,
    "cursor": "eyJsYXN0SWQiOjEyMzQ1LCJsYXN0VmFsdWUiOiIyMDI1LTAxLTE1VDEwOjMwOjAwWiJ9"
  },
  "_links": {
    "self": {
      "href": "/api/v1/claims?page=1&pageSize=50"
    },
    "first": {
      "href": "/api/v1/claims?page=1&pageSize=50"
    },
    "last": {
      "href": "/api/v1/claims?page=251&pageSize=50"
    },
    "next": {
      "href": "/api/v1/claims?page=2&pageSize=50"
    },
    "previous": null
  },
  "meta": {
    "requestId": "req-789012",
    "timestamp": "2025-01-15T10:30:00Z",
    "apiVersion": "v1"
  }
}
```

**Response Fields:**

| Field | Type | Description | Required |
|-------|------|-------------|----------|
| `items` | array | Collection of resources | Yes |
| `pagination` | object | Pagination metadata | Yes |
| `pagination.page` | number | Current page (offset mode) | Offset only |
| `pagination.pageSize` | number | Records per page | Yes |
| `pagination.totalRecords` | number | Total count (expensive for large datasets) | Offset only |
| `pagination.totalPages` | number | Calculated total pages | Offset only |
| `pagination.hasMore` | boolean | More results available | Yes |
| `pagination.cursor` | string | Opaque continuation token (cursor mode) | Cursor only |
| `_links` | object | HATEOAS navigation links | Yes |
| `_links.self` | object | Current page link | Yes |
| `_links.first` | object | First page link | Yes |
| `_links.last` | object | Last page link | Offset only |
| `_links.next` | object | Next page link | If hasMore |
| `_links.previous` | object | Previous page link | If not first |
| `meta` | object | Request metadata | Yes |

