| **Payload Size** | 2.5 MB JSON | 50 KB JSON |
| **Database Query Time** | 25 seconds | 80ms |
| **Timeout Rate** | 12% | <1% |
| **User Satisfaction** | 3.2/5 (complaints about slowness) | 4.7/5 |

